post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
==> keychrontray installed.
    Start it:            keychrontray &      (or from the application menu: "Keychron Tray")
    Start at every login: keychrontray autostart on
                         (or tick "Start automatically at login" in the tray menu)
    The udev rule (/usr/lib/udev/rules.d/70-keychrontray.rules) gives your user access to the
    keyboard. Replug the keyboard once so it applies. Lighting control needs the USB cable.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
    :
}
